{"id":"788130d97ad6b7a6","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-internal-language.md","title":"完整内部语言的评价与往返","display":"thm-internal-language-correspondence — 完整内部语言的评价与往返","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"10","label":"16-thm-internal-language","aliases":["16-thm-internal-language","16-thm--internal-language"],"display":"thm-internal-language-correspondence — 完整内部语言的评价与往返","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]","[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]","[[16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model]]"],"source":"Local reconstruction for the supplied strong DTT fragment; §§10.3–10.4","revision_date":"2026-10-19","formalization_scope":"Ranked presentations, strict evaluation, and contextual-density criterion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-internal-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-internal-language</span><span>16-thm--internal-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-internal-language-correspondence — 完整内部语言的评价与往返"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64dd825bd60fb1b8\" href=\"?note=64dd825bd60fb1b8\" title=\"16-df-dtt-internal-language\">16-df-dtt-internal-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d0c7afd20e93018d\" href=\"?note=d0c7afd20e93018d\" title=\"16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model\">16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Local reconstruction for the supplied strong DTT fragment; §§10.3–10.4"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Ranked presentations, strict evaluation, and contextual-density criterion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用含选择公理的集合论，固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)\">\\(\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(S)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr P=(\\Lambda,r)\">\\(\\mathscr P=(\\Lambda,r)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\mathscr P)\">\\(\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\mathscr P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足给定有限强片段的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>。从集合大小范畴的满忠实且本质满函子构造准逆时使用此选择公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spec},\\operatorname{Cl},\\rho_S,\\Lambda_S,\\varepsilon_S,G_S,\\mathsf{CtxDense},\\mathsf{DTTEquiv},\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}},\\operatorname{rk}\">\\(\\operatorname{Spec},\\operatorname{Cl},\\rho_S,\\Lambda_S,\\varepsilon_S,G_S,\\mathsf{CtxDense},\\mathsf{DTTEquiv},\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}},\\operatorname{rk}\\)</span> 全部采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64dd825bd60fb1b8\" href=\"?note=64dd825bd60fb1b8\" title=\"16-df-dtt-internal-language\">16-df-dtt-internal-language</a> 的显式构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Decl}_{(S,\\rho_S)}\">\\(\\mathsf{Decl}_{(S,\\rho_S)}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a> 的四种声明满足公式；这些公式本身不要求声明集合有限。</li>\n<li>下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{Spec}(S))\">\\(S^{\\mathrm{syn}}=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{Spec}(S))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathscr P)\">\\(T=\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathscr P)\\)</span> 为定义式缩写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_C\">\\(\\varepsilon_C\\)</span> 的对象映射和逐 Hom 映射按类型区分。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\">\\(f:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Y\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是指定两个集合之间的双射。</li>\n<li>有限展示的可靠解释、语境转换、同时商及逐操作结构验证采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a>；本页不假设评价的满忠实性、类型或项双射性，也不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CtxDense}(S)\">\\(\\mathsf{CtxDense}(S)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\operatorname{Spec}(S))\\ &amp;\\land\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho_S)=\\operatorname{sym}(\\Lambda_S)\\\n\\land(\\forall s\\in\\Lambda_S)\\ \\mathsf{Decl}_{(S,\\rho_S)}(s),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(T)\\ &amp;\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_T=G_T,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\operatorname{Spec}(S))\\ &amp;\\land\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho_S)=\\operatorname{sym}(\\Lambda_S)\\\n\\land(\\forall s\\in\\Lambda_S)\\ \\mathsf{Decl}_{(S,\\rho_S)}(s),\\\\\n\\mathsf{SplitDTT}(T)\\ &amp;\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_T=G_T,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RankedDTT}(\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strict}_{\\varnothing}\n\\bigl(\\varepsilon_S;(S^{\\mathrm{syn}},\\varnothing),(S,\\varnothing)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Strict}_{\\varnothing}\n\\bigl(\\varepsilon_S;(S^{\\mathrm{syn}},\\varnothing),(S,\\varnothing)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall U,V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{C,U,V}:\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U,V)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal C_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU,(\\varepsilon_S)_CV),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{T,U}:\\operatorname{Ty}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Ty}_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U))\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{t,U,A}:\\operatorname{Tm}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U,A)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Tm}_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU,(\\varepsilon_S)_{T,U}A),\\\\\n&amp;\\{(\\varepsilon_S)_CU\\mid U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}\\}=G_S.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall U,V\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{C,U,V}:\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U,V)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathcal C_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU,(\\varepsilon_S)_CV),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{T,U}:\\operatorname{Ty}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Ty}_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU),\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}})\n(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U))\\quad\n(\\varepsilon_S)_{t,U,A}:\\operatorname{Tm}_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}(U,A)\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Tm}_S((\\varepsilon_S)_CU,(\\varepsilon_S)_{T,U}A),\\\\\n&amp;\\{(\\varepsilon_S)_CU\\mid U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_{S^{\\mathrm{syn}}}\\}=G_S.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CtxDense}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DTTEquiv}(\\varepsilon_S;S^{\\mathrm{syn}},S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CtxDense}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{DTTEquiv}(\\varepsilon_S;S^{\\mathrm{syn}},S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{DTTEquiv}\\bigl(\\varepsilon_T;\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{Spec}(T)),T\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathscr P\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\\operatorname{Spec}(\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathscr P)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\n\\operatorname{Spec}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{DTTEquiv}\\bigl(\\varepsilon_T;\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{Spec}(T)),T\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathscr P\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\\operatorname{Spec}(\\operatorname{Cl}(\\mathscr P)),\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\n\\operatorname{Spec}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Cl}(\\operatorname{rk}(\\Sigma))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>分层解释及商。</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{n+1}\">\\(\\Lambda_{n+1}\\)</span> 中，新符号的声明语境和类型均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_n\">\\(\\Lambda_n\\)</span> 中形成，赋值属于这些语境与类型的解释；新方程只取已良型端点的实际语义相等。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 归纳可证明各层声明准入和满足。任意有限推导使用有限个声明；为每条声明取其有限准入推导，沿严格下降的自然数秩追溯，得到有限依赖集。将该集按秩排序得到合法有限展示。因此有限展示的可靠性、语境转换、替换与同余证明逐推导适用。商上的全部操作代表无关，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\\)</span>；评价保留其原始构造子，给出严格态射。</p>\n<p><strong>类型与项的满射、单射。</strong> 固定一个已形成语境代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。它出现在某一有限层；该层之后为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_S(⟦\\Gamma⟧)\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_S(⟦\\Gamma⟧)\\)</span> 加入类型符号，并在其恒等替换实例上解释成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。固定已形成类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 后同理命名每个该类型的语义项。这给出两个满射。若两个已良型类型或项解释相等，则其形成推导同时包含在某一层；下一层加入相应方程。这给出商上的单射。对于不同但相等的语境、类型代表，先使用明示的转换关系将端点置于同一代表上。</p>\n<p><strong>基函子的满忠实性。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:⟦\\Gamma⟧\\to⟦\\Delta⟧\">\\(f:⟦\\Gamma⟧\\to⟦\\Delta⟧\\)</span>，沿目标语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 的有限扩张，理解配对公理把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 唯一分解为逐项依赖元组。由项满射逐分量选取语法项，得到解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的良型替换。两替换解释相等时，从其各前缀投影得到对应分量的解释相等；类型转换及新增真方程给出逐分量判断等式，从而替换商相等。</p>\n<p><strong>对象像及往返。</strong> 空语境解释为所选终对象，每个语境扩张解释为一次所选类型扩张，故像包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_S\">\\(G_S\\)</span>。反向对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_S\">\\(G_S\\)</span> 的构造归纳，使用类型满射表示每次扩张，得到对象像恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_S\">\\(G_S\\)</span>。结合已证满忠实性，评价基函子为范畴等价当且仅当每个基对象同构于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_S\">\\(G_S\\)</span> 中的对象；在集合大小范畴上选取这些同构即构造准逆和自然同构。分类模型的每个对象由其有限语境代表从空语境扩张而来，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_T=G_T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C_T=G_T\\)</span>，应用前式得到第二次往返。有限展示通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rk}\">\\(\\operatorname{rk}\\)</span> 嵌入分层展示后结论相同。</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d0c7afd20e93018d\" href=\"?note=d0c7afd20e93018d\" title=\"16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model\">16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model</a> 说明一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\">\\(\\mathsf{SplitDTT}\\)</span> 不能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CtxDense}\">\\(\\mathsf{CtxDense}\\)</span>。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\">\\(\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}}\\)</span> 比较分类结构，允许新增可定义符号及真方程；它不宣称重新取内部语言后原始常量名和声明列表不变。该条件和等价层级已经完整写入 Hypothesis 与 Assertion。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-internal-language","status":"resolved","id":"64dd825bd60fb1b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"d0c7afd20e93018d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-ex-noncontextual-dtt-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-internal-language","status":"resolved","id":"64dd825bd60fb1b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Spec},\\operatorname{Cl},\\rho_S,\\Lambda_S,\\varepsilon_S,G_S,\\mathsf{CtxDense},\\mathsf{DTTEquiv},\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}},\\operatorname{rk}$ 全部采用 [[16-df-dtt-internal-language]] 的显式构造。$\\mathsf{Decl}_{(S,\\rho_S)}$ 使用 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的四种声明满足公式；这些公式本身不要求声明集合有限。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Spec},\\operatorname{Cl},\\rho_S,\\Lambda_S,\\varepsilon_S,G_S,\\mathsf{CtxDense},\\mathsf{DTTEquiv},\\simeq_{\\mathrm{pres}},\\operator